{"id":"forecast-04","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-04/audio-1.mp3","model":"small","duration":440.82,"segments":[{"start":1.01,"end":5.33,"text":"IELTS Listening, version K0012.","words":[["IELTS",1.01,1.85],["Listening,",1.85,2.23],["version",2.73,3.09],["K0012.",3.09,5.33]]},{"start":6.89,"end":12.31,"text":"You will hear a number of different recordings and you will have to answer questions on what","words":[["You",6.89,7.53],["will",7.53,7.71],["hear",7.71,7.93],["a",7.93,8.11],["number",8.11,8.43],["of",8.43,8.69],["different",8.69,8.99],["recordings",8.99,9.55],["and",9.55,10.35],["you",10.35,10.49],["will",10.49,10.59],["have",10.59,10.79],["to",10.79,10.91],["answer",10.91,11.21],["questions",11.21,11.71],["on",11.71,12.09],["what",12.09,12.31]]},{"start":12.31,"end":18.07,"text":"you hear. There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions and you will","words":[["you",12.31,12.47],["hear.",12.47,12.79],["There",13.61,14.13],["will",14.13,14.25],["be",14.25,14.41],["time",14.41,14.73],["for",14.73,14.97],["you",14.97,15.09],["to",15.09,15.19],["read",15.19,15.51],["the",15.51,15.75],["instructions",15.75,16.23],["and",16.23,16.59],["questions",16.59,16.93],["and",16.93,17.81],["you",17.81,17.97],["will",17.97,18.07]]},{"start":18.07,"end":23.45,"text":"have a chance to check your work. All the recordings will be played once only.","words":[["have",18.07,18.21],["a",18.21,18.39],["chance",18.39,18.61],["to",18.61,18.81],["check",18.81,19.13],["your",19.13,19.31],["work.",19.31,19.65],["All",20.77,21.07],["the",21.07,21.19],["recordings",21.19,21.55],["will",21.55,21.89],["be",21.89,22.03],["played",22.03,22.39],["once",22.39,22.91],["only.",22.91,23.45]]},{"start":23.45,"end":30.55,"text":"Finally, the test is in four sections. Write all your answers in the listening question","words":[["Finally,",23.45,23.61],["the",24.29,24.89],["test",24.89,25.29],["is",25.29,25.89],["in",25.89,26.03],["four",26.03,26.43],["sections.",26.43,26.