look",59.94,60.06],["at",60.06,60.18],["questions",60.18,60.5],["1",60.5,60.96],["to",60.96,61.12],["7",61.12,61.52],["on",61.52,62.02],["page",62.02,62.26],["2.",62.26,62.72]]},{"start":92.88,"end":98.0,"text":"You will see that there is an example that has been done for you. On this occasion only,","words":[["You",92.88,93.28],["will",93.28,93.42],["see",93.42,93.66],["that",93.66,93.86],["there",93.86,94.02],["is",94.02,94.16],["an",94.16,94.28],["example",94.28,94.74],["that",94.74,95.02],["has",95.02,95.14],["been",95.14,95.3],["done",95.3,95.6],["for",95.6,95.9],["you.",95.9,96.16],["On",96.84,97.16],["this",97.16,97.34],["occasion",97.34,97.64],["only,",97.64,98.0]]},{"start":98.52,"end":101.08,"text":"the conversation relating to this will be played first.","words":[["the",98.52,98.7],["conversation",98.7,99.12],["relating",99.12,99.7],["to",99.7,99.94],["this",99.94,100.16],["will",100.16,100.3],["be",100.3,100.42],["played",100.42,100.74],["first.",100.74,101.08]]},{"start":104.53,"end":107.73,"text":"Hi Anna. How was your holiday to Jackson Island?","words":[["Hi",104.53,104.95],["Anna.",104.95,105.23],["How",105.85,106.05],["was",106.05,106.21],["your",106.21,106.33],["holiday",106.33,106.65],["to",106.65,106.89],["Jackson",106.89,107.25],["Island?",107.25,107.73]]},{"start":108.29,"end":112.47,"text":"It was good. There's quite a lot to see. It's quite a big island really.","words":[["It",108.29,108.45],["was",108.45,108.57],["good.",108.57,108.81],["There's",109.29,109.51],["quite",109.51,109.71],["a",109.71,109.89],["lot",109.89,110.03],["to",110.03,110.21],["see.",110.21,110.47],["It's",110.93,111.19],["quite",111.19,111.39],["a",111.39,111.55],["big",111.55,111.77],["island",111.77,112.19],["really.",112.19,112.47]]},{"start":112.69,"end":117.59,"text":"Yeah. I was thinking of going in the summer. So where would you recommend going on the","words":[["Yeah.",112.69,113.01],["I",113.45,113.73],["was",113.73,113.87],["thinking",113.87,114.09],["of",114.09,114.33],["going",114.33,114.53],["in",114.53,114.71],["the",114.71,114.83],["summer.",114.83,115.23],["So",115.73,116.01],["where",116.01,116.25],["would",116.25,116.39],["you",116.39,116.49],["recommend",116.49,116.79],["going",116.79,117.21],["on",117.21,117.47],["the",117.47,117.59]]},{"start":117.59,"end":126.56,"text":"island. Well the capital of course, Camford. I stayed there with my cousin. Anna stayed","words":[["island.",117.59,117.91],["Well",118.27,118.67],["the",118.67,118.93],["capital",118.93,119.41],["of",119.41,119.61],["course,",119.61,119.87],["Camford.",120.23,120.67],["I",121.17,121.37],["stayed",121.37,121.57],["there",121.57,121.79],["with",121.79,121.93],["my",121.93,122.11],["cousin.",122.11,122.35],["Anna",125.92,126.26],["stayed",126.26,126.56]]},{"start":126.56,"end":133.88,"text":"with her cousin, so cousin has been written in the space. Now we shall begin. You should","words":[["with",126.56,126.84],["her",126.84,126.96],["cousin,",126.96,127.32],["so",127.78,128.08],["cousin",128.08,128.74],["has",128.74,129.08],["been",129.08,129.24],["written",129.24,129.46],["in",129.46,129.66],["the",129.66,129.76],["space.",129.76,130.08],["Now",131.68,131.94],["we",131.94,132.08],["shall",132.08,132.24],["begin.",132.24,132.6],["You",133.56,133.76],["should",133.76,133.88]]},{"start":133.88,"end":137.94,"text":"answer the questions as you listen because you will not hear the recording a second","words":[["answer",133.88,134.12],["the",134.12,134.32],["questions",134.32,134.74],["as",134.74,135.12],["you",135.12,135.28],["listen",135.28,135.62],["because",135.62,136.16],["you",136.16,136.4],["will",136.4,136.5],["not",136.5,136.76],["hear",136.76,136.98],["the",136.98,137.1],["recording",137.1,137.46],["a",137.46,137.72],["second",137.72,137.94]]},{"start":137.94,"end":148.23,"text":"time. Listen carefully and answer questions one to seven. Hi Anna, how was your holiday","words":[["time.",137.94,138.36],["Listen",139.38,139.98],["carefully",139.98,140.42],["and",140.42,140.76],["answer",140.76,141.12],["questions",141.12,141.66],["one",141.66,142.04],["to",142.04,142.22],["seven.",142.22,142.52],["Hi",146.05,146.49],["Anna,",146.49,146.81],["how",147.33,147.61],["was",147.61,147.77],["your",147.77,147.89],["holiday",147.89,148.23]]},{"start":148.23,"end":154.03,"text":"to Jackson Island. It was good. There's quite a lot to see. It's quite a big island really.","words":[["to",148.23,148.47],["Jackson",148.47,148.79],["Island.",148.79,149.31],["It",149.83,150.01],["was",150.01,150.13],["good.",150.13,150.39],["There's",150.83,151.07],["quite",151.07,151.27],["a",151.27,151.45],["lot",151.45,151.59],["to",151.59,151.77],["see.",151.77,152.03],["It's",152.53,152.75],["quite",152.75,152.93],["a",152.93,153.13],["big",153.13,153.33],["island",153.33,153.75],["really.",153.75,154.03]]},{"start":154.31,"end":159.41,"text":"Yeah. I was thinking of going in the summer. So where would you recommend going on the island?","words":[["Yeah.",154.31,154.57],["I",155.03,155.29],["was",155.29,155.43],["thinking",155.43,155.67],["of",155.67,155.89],["going",155.89,156.09],["in",156.09,156.27],["the",156.27,156.39],["summer.",156.39,156.79],["So",157.29,157.57],["where",157.57,157.81],["would",157.81,157.97],["you",157.97,158.05],["recommend",158.05,158.33],["going",158.33,158.77],["on",158.77,159.03],["the",159.03,159.15],["island?",159.15,159.41]]},{"start":159.97,"end":163.89,"text":"Well the capital of course, Camford. I stayed there with my cousin.","words":[["Well",159.97,160.25],["the",160.25,160.49],["capital",160.49,160.97],["of",160.97,161.17],["course,",161.17,161.39],["Camford.",161.81,162.21],["I",162.73,162.93],["stayed",162.93,163.13],["there",163.13,163.35],["with",163.35,163.49],["my",163.49,163.65],["cousin.",163.65,163.89]]},{"start":164.59,"end":168.87,"text":"What did you do there? Well actually I spent most of my time there shopping.","words":[["What",164.59,164.85],["did",164.85,164.99],["you",164.99,165.11],["do",165.11,165.29],["there?",165.29,165.57],["Well",166.09,166.45],["actually",166.45,166.85],["I",166.85,167.07],["spent",167.07,167.31],["most",167.31,167.69],["of",167.69,167.89],["my",167.89,168.05],["time",168.05,168.35],["there",168.35,168.59],["shopping.",168.59,168.87]]},{"start":169.43,"end":174.33,"text":"So has it got good shopping centres? Yes but they're the same as at home really.","words":[["So",169.43,169.73],["has",169.73,169.95],["it",169.95,170.03],["got",170.03,170.19],["good",170.19,170.41],["shopping",170.41,170.73],["centres?",170.73,171.13],["Yes",171.87,172.35],["but",172.35,172.69],["they're",172.69,173.03],["the",173.03,173.13],["same",173.13,173.37],["as",173.37,173.53],["at",173.53,173.65],["home",173.65,173.93],["really.",173.93,174.33]]},{"start":174.33,"end":178.07,"text":"So I did all my shopping in the market, which is great!","words":[["So",174.33,175.03],["I",175.03,175.27],["did",175.27,175.39],["all",175.39,175.57],["my",175.57,175.75],["shopping",175.75,176.13],["in",176.13,176.39],["the",176.39,176.51],["market,",176.51,176.93],["which",177.21,177.49],["is",177.49,177.65],["great!",177.65,178.07]]},{"start":178.77,"end":180.85,"text":"What kinds of things are good to buy there?","words":[["What",178.77,178.95],["kinds",178.95,179.31],["of",179.31,179.55],["things",179.55,179.83],["are",179.83,180.05],["good",180.05,180.17],["to",180.17,180.35],["buy",180.35,180.57],["there?",180.57,180.85]]},{"start":181.27,"end":183.99,"text":"Everything! But bags and shoes especially!","words":[["Everything!",181.27,181.69],["But",182.39,182.51],["bags",182.51,182.99],["and",182.99,183.23],["shoes",183.23,183.55],["especially!",183.55,183.99]]},{"start":184.95,"end":189.21,"text":"Just make sure you've got cash with you, as most of the stalls don't take credit cards.","words":[["Just",184.95,185.19],["make",185.19,185.39],["sure",185.39,185.57],["you've",185.57,185.77],["got",185.77,185.89],["cash",185.89,186.19],["with",186.19,186.41],["you,",186.41,186.63],["as",186.87,187.13],["most",187.13,187.37],["of",187.37,187.53],["the",187.53,187.65],["stalls",187.65,187.93],["don't",187.93,188.35],["take",188.35,188.55],["credit",188.55,188.83],["cards.",188.83,189.21]]},{"start":189.37,"end":192.39,"text":"Okay, that's good to know. Where else did you go?","words":[["Okay,",189.37,189.83],["that's",189.99,190.27],["good",190.27,190.41],["to",190.41,190.61],["know.",190.61,190.83],["Where",191.43,191.69],["else",191.69,191.97],["did",191.97,192.09],["you",192.09,192.21],["go?",192.21,192.39]]},{"start":193.05,"end":198.57,"text":"Well, my cousin and I went to Newtown. She said it was famous for its modern architecture.","words":[["Well,",193.05,193.47],["my",193.57,193.85],["cousin",193.85,194.13],["and",194.13,194.39],["I",194.39,194.65],["went",194.65,194.85],["to",194.85,195.07],["Newtown.",195.07,195.59],["She",196.19,196.37],["said",196.37,196.55],["it",196.55,196.65],["was",196.65,196.75],["famous",196.75,197.11],["for",197.11,197.39],["its",197.39,197.51],["modern",197.51,197.87],["architecture.",197.87,198.57]]},{"start":199.21,"end":203.17,"text":"We only had half a day there, so we took a bus tour around the town.","words":[["We",199.21,199.47],["only",199.47,199.69],["had",199.69,199.95],["half",199.95,200.25],["a",200.25,200.39],["day",200.39,200.59],["there,",200.59,200.97],["so",201.09,201.31],["we",201.31,201.49],["took",201.49,201.65],["a",201.65,201.81],["bus",201.81,201.99],["tour",201.99,202.33],["around",202.33,202.67],["the",202.67,202.81],["town.",202.81,203.17]]},{"start":203.17,"end":206.51,"text":"But if I were you, I'd give the bus tour a miss.","words":[["But",203.17,203.79],["if",203.79,204.11],["I",204.11,204.29],["were",204.29,204.45],["you,",204.45,204.73],["I'd",204.97,205.19],["give",205.19,205.31],["the",205.31,205.47],["bus",205.47,205.67],["tour",205.67,205.99],["a",205.99,206.19],["miss.",206.19,206.51]]},{"start":207.11,"end":210.93,"text":"Unless you know a lot about architecture, the buildings all look the same.","words":[["Unless",207.11,207.45],["you",207.45,207.73],["know",207.73,207.91],["a",207.91,208.07],["lot",208.07,208.27],["about",208.27,208.55],["architecture,",208.55,209.27],["the",209.69,209.79],["buildings",209.79,210.05],["all",210.05,210.35],["look",210.35,210.53],["the",210.53,210.65],["same.",210.65,210.93]]},{"start":211.61,"end":214.73,"text":"There's a museum though, that's supposed to be good. You might like that.","words":[["There's",211.61,211.87],["a",211.87,211.93],["museum",211.93,212.27],["though,",212.27,212.51],["that's",212.75,212.99],["supposed",212.99,213.19],["to",213.19,213.39],["be",213.39,213.47],["good.",213.47,213.67],["You",213.93,214.05],["might",214.05,214.21],["like",214.21,214.45],["that.",214.45,214.73]]},{"start":214.93,"end":216.23,"text":"OK, I'll give it a go.","words":[["OK,",214.93,215.35],["I'll",215.61,215.73],["give",215.73,215.83],["it",215.83,215.93],["a",215.93,216.01],["go.",216.01,216.23]]},{"start":216.87,"end":223.55,"text":"Then after that we headed for Golden Beach because we were going to meet up with an old friend that I hadn't seen for years.","words":[["Then",216.87,217.27],["after",217.27,217.63],["that",217.63,217.91],["we",217.91,218.19],["headed",218.19,218.47],["for",218.47,218.83],["Golden",218.83,219.19],["Beach",219.19,219.61],["because",219.61,220.27],["we",220.27,220.51],["were",220.51,220.61],["going",220.61,220.77],["to",220.77,220.93],["meet",220.93,221.07],["up",221.07,221.27],["with",221.27,221.41],["an",221.41,221.53],["old",221.53,221.69],["friend",221.69,222.03],["that",222.03,222.25],["I",222.25,222.39],["hadn't",222.39,222.57],["seen",222.57,222.83],["for",222.83,223.03],["years.",223.03,223.55]]},{"start":224.07,"end":227.65,"text":"But we had to stay in a caravan as the hotels were all booked up.","words":[["But",224.07,224.31],["we",224.31,224.47],["had",224.47,224.63],["to",224.63,224.77],["stay",224.77,224.95],["in",224.95,225.07],["a",225.07,225.17],["caravan",225.17,225.65],["as",225.65,226.17],["the",226.17,226.29],["hotels",226.29,226.67],["were",226.67,226.95],["all",226.95,227.07],["booked",227.07,227.35],["up.",227.35,227.65]]},{"start":228.47,"end":230.43,"text":"Is it as pretty as it looks in the brochures?","words":[["Is",228.47,228.67],["it",228.67,228.77],["as",228.77,228.91],["pretty",228.91,229.15],["as",229.15,229.31],["it",229.31,229.43],["looks",229.43,229.57],["in",229.57,229.79],["the",229.79,229.91],["brochures?",229.91,230.43]]},{"start":230.43,"end":237.79,"text":"Yes, it's very picturesque. We did some sailing on the most beautiful Blue Sea. It was so","words":[["Yes,",230.43,231.29],["it's",231.81,232.07],["very",232.07,232.47],["picturesque.",232.47,233.43],["We",233.63,233.81],["did",233.81,233.97],["some",233.97,234.17],["sailing",234.17,234.63],["on",234.63,234.85],["the",234.85,234.97],["most",234.97,235.19],["beautiful",235.19,235.83],["Blue",235.83,236.13],["Sea.",236.13,236.47],["It",237.21,237.35],["was",237.35,237.49],["so",237.49,237.79]]},{"start":237.79,"end":243.03,"text":"clear that you could see the bottom, even quite far out to sea. That part of the trip was","words":[["clear",237.79,238.19],["that",238.19,238.39],["you",238.39,238.53],["could",238.53,238.65],["see",238.65,238.79],["the",238.79,238.91],["bottom,",238.91,239.21],["even",239.77,240.03],["quite",240.03,240.29],["far",240.29,240.57],["out",240.57,240.79],["to",240.79,240.97],["sea.",240.97,241.23],["That",241.87,242.13],["part",242.13,242.39],["of",242.39,242.55],["the",242.55,242.67],["trip",242.67,242.83],["was",242.83,243.03]]},{"start":243.03,"end":248.41,"text":"great and I'd have liked to have stayed even longer. I'd suggest staying there for a minimum","words":[["great",243.03,243.51],["and",243.51,243.97],["I'd",243.97,244.15],["have",244.15,244.23],["liked",244.23,244.47],["to",244.47,244.67],["have",244.67,244.77],["stayed",244.77,245.09],["even",245.09,245.49],["longer.",245.49,245.99],["I'd",246.57,246.83],["suggest",246.83,247.03],["staying",247.03,247.45],["there",247.45,247.73],["for",247.73,247.91],["a",247.91,248.01],["minimum",248.01,248.41]]},{"start":248.41,"end":253.13,"text":"of four days if I were you. We had two days there and it wasn't nearly enough.","words":[["of",248.41,248.73],["four",248.73,249.07],["days",249.07,249.37],["if",249.37,249.55],["I",249.55,249.71],["were",249.71,249.83],["you.",249.83,250.05],["We",250.53,250.71],["had",250.71,250.91],["two",250.91,251.15],["days",251.15,251.45],["there",251.45,251.75],["and",251.75,251.97],["it",251.97,252.07],["wasn't",252.07,252.41],["nearly",252.41,252.77],["enough.",252.77,253.13]]},{"start":253.37,"end":258.57,"text":"Sounds great. I'll put that on my must do list. Was that the end of your trip?","words":[["Sounds",253.37,253.65],["great.",253.65,254.09],["I'll",254.69,254.93],["put",254.93,255.07],["that",255.07,255.25],["on",255.25,255.37],["my",255.37,255.53],["must",255.53,255.85],["do",255.85,256.17],["list.",256.17,256.57],["Was",257.31,257.51],["that",257.51,257.71],["the",257.71,257.85],["end",257.85,258.05],["of",258.05,258.17],["your",258.17,258.29],["trip?",258.29,258.57]]},{"start":258.57,"end":264.39,"text":"No. After Golden Beach we drove into the centre of the island to White Mountain.","words":[["No.",258.57,259.15],["After",259.59,259.99],["Golden",259.99,260.27],["Beach",260.27,260.67],["we",260.67,261.03],["drove",261.03,261.27],["into",261.27,261.57],["the",261.57,261.77],["centre",261.77,262.09],["of",262.09,262.31],["the",262.31,262.43],["island",262.43,262.77],["to",262.77,263.49],["White",263.49,263.91],["Mountain.",263.91,264.39]]},{"start":264.75,"end":265.97,"text":"White as in the colour?","words":[["White",264.75,265.11],["as",265.11,265.49],["in",265.49,265.63],["the",265.63,265.75],["colour?",265.75,265.97]]},{"start":266.35,"end":272.87,"text":"Yes. The island's great because you can go from the beaches up to the snowy mountain in a couple of hours.","words":[["Yes.",266.35,266.67],["The",267.29,267.47],["island's",267.47,267.95],["great",267.95,268.37],["because",268.37,268.85],["you",268.85,269.07],["can",269.07,269.23],["go",269.23,269.43],["from",269.43,269.65],["the",269.65,269.81],["beaches",269.81,270.19],["up",270.19,270.79],["to",270.79,270.93],["the",270.93,271.11],["snowy",271.11,271.51],["mountain",271.51,271.85],["in",271.85,272.19],["a",272.19,272.29],["couple",272.29,272.43],["of",272.43,272.55],["hours.",272.55,272.87]]},{"start":273.39,"end":278.33,"text":"We took a tent because we were going to camp but the weather was so cold.","words":[["We",273.39,273.93],["took",273.93,274.15],["a",274.15,274.33],["tent",274.33,274.55],["because",274.55,275.09],["we",275.09,275.35],["were",275.35,275.45],["going",275.45,275.61],["to",275.61,275.77],["camp",275.77,276.11],["but",276.11,276.83],["the",276.83,277.01],["weather",277.01,277.19],["was",277.19,277.41],["so",277.41,277.73],["cold.",277.73,278.33]]},{"start":278.49,"end":282.35,"text":"In fact it was snowing when I was there that we stopped in a motel instead.","words":[["In",278.49,278.59],["fact",278.59,278.79],["it",278.79,278.91],["was",278.91,279.03],["snowing",279.03,279.55],["when",279.55,279.67],["I",279.67,279.85],["was",279.85,280.01],["there",280.01,280.27],["that",280.27,280.83],["we",280.83,280.99],["stopped",280.99,281.25],["in",281.25,281.43],["a",281.43,281.53],["motel",281.53,281.95],["instead.",281.95,282.35]]},{"start":282.67,"end":283.95,"text":"Did you go skiing then?","words":[["Did",282.67,282.95],["you",282.95,283.07],["go",283.07,283.21],["skiing",283.21,283.59],["then?",283.59,283.95]]},{"start":283.95,"end":289.99,"text":"No. But we tried snowboarding and it was harder than it looked. It looked so easy when you","words":[["No.",283.95,284.55],["But",284.93,285.19],["we",285.19,285.35],["tried",285.35,285.57],["snowboarding",285.57,286.33],["and",286.33,286.81],["it",286.81,286.95],["was",286.95,287.07],["harder",287.07,287.41],["than",287.41,287.61],["it",287.61,287.71],["looked.",287.71,287.99],["It",288.61,288.77],["looked",288.77,288.95],["so",288.95,289.23],["easy",289.23,289.61],["when",289.61,289.85],["you",289.85,289.99]]},{"start":289.99,"end":295.33,"text":"see other people doing it, but it took me ages to get the hang of it. I wish I'd had some","words":[["see",289.99,290.13],["other",290.13,290.33],["people",290.33,290.63],["doing",290.63,290.97],["it,",290.97,291.23],["but",291.55,291.83],["it",291.83,291.95],["took",291.95,292.11],["me",292.11,292.33],["ages",292.33,292.87],["to",292.87,293.13],["get",293.13,293.25],["the",293.25,293.41],["hang",293.41,293.55],["of",293.55,293.67],["it.",293.67,293.89],["I",294.47,294.63],["wish",294.63,294.81],["I'd",294.81,295.01],["had",295.01,295.13],["some",295.13,295.33]]},{"start":295.33,"end":297.97,"text":"lessons, but you had to make your bookings in advance.","words":[["lessons,",295.33,295.79],["but",296.15,296.43],["you",296.43,296.55],["had",296.55,296.67],["to",296.67,296.83],["make",296.83,296.95],["your",296.95,297.09],["bookings",297.09,297.53],["in",297.53,297.63],["advance.",297.63,297.97]]},{"start":298.41,"end":300.31,"text":"Okay, I'll look into that. Thanks.","words":[["Okay,",298.41,298.85],["I'll",299.03,299.17],["look",299.17,299.31],["into",299.31,299.51],["that.",299.51,299.81],["Thanks.",300.01,300.31]]},{"start":303.98,"end":308.32,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions","words":[["Before",303.98,304.46],["you",304.46,304.7],["hear",304.7,304.92],["the",304.92,305.1],["rest",305.1,305.32],["of",305.32,305.44],["the",305.44,305.52],["conversation,",305.52,306.08],["you",306.58,306.82],["have",306.82,306.98],["some",306.98,307.16],["time",307.16,307.54],["to",307.54,307.74],["look",307.74,307.84],["at",307.84,307.98],["questions",307.98,308.32]]},{"start":308.32,"end":328.7,"text":"8 to 10 on page 2. Now listen and answer questions 8 to 10.","words":[["8",308.32,308.88],["to",308.88,309.04],["10",309.04,309.4],["on",309.4,310.04],["page",310.04,310.3],["2.",310.3,310.76],["Now",325.88,326.18],["listen",326.18,326.46],["and",326.46,326.8],["answer",326.8,327.12],["questions",327.12,327.56],["8",327.56,328.18],["to",328.18,328.34],["10.",328.34,328.7]]},{"start":328.7,"end":334.66,"text":"So are there any other tips or advice you could give me?","words":[["So",328.7,329.68],["are",332.4,332.6],["there",332.6,332.68],["any",332.68,332.86],["other",332.86,333.08],["tips",333.08,333.4],["or",333.4,333.62],["advice",333.62,334.0],["you",334.0,334.16],["could",334.16,334.26],["give",334.26,334.44],["me?",334.44,334.66]]},{"start":335.22,"end":337.36,"text":"I don't know. Let me think.","words":[["I",335.22,335.46],["don't",335.46,335.64],["know.",335.64,336.02],["Let",336.5,336.66],["me",336.66,336.8],["think.",336.8,337.36]]},{"start":338.36,"end":342.44,"text":"Oh, one place you should try to visit is this very quaint cafe,","words":[["Oh,",338.36,338.84],["one",339.0,339.34],["place",339.34,339.64],["you",339.64,339.88],["should",339.88,340.0],["try",340.0,340.22],["to",340.22,340.36],["visit",340.36,340.66],["is",340.66,340.96],["this",340.96,341.16],["very",341.16,341.56],["quaint",341.56,341.96],["cafe,",341.96,342.44]]},{"start":342.86,"end":344.3,"text":"which is at the foot of the mountain.","words":[["which",342.86,343.16],["is",343.16,343.3],["at",343.3,343.42],["the",343.42,343.5],["foot",343.5,343.72],["of",343.72,343.9],["the",343.9,344.0],["mountain.",344.0,344.3]]},{"start":345.04,"end":347.08,"text":"It has the best cakes ever.","words":[["It",345.04,345.2],["has",345.2,345.44],["the",345.44,345.62],["best",345.62,346.06],["cakes",346.06,346.56],["ever.",346.56,347.08]]},{"start":347.38,"end":349.04,"text":"It's worth going there just for them.","words":[["It's",347.38,347.56],["worth",347.56,347.76],["going",347.76,348.04],["there",348.04,348.3],["just",348.3,348.58],["for",348.58,348.82],["them.",348.82,349.04]]},{"start":349.52,"end":350.84,"text":"I'll have to try those.","words":[["I'll",349.52,350.04],["have",350.04,350.14],["to",350.14,350.26],["try",350.26,350.54],["those.",350.54,350.84]]},{"start":351.54,"end":353.38,"text":"So what other advice would you give?","words":[["So",351.54,351.86],["what",351.86,352.2],["other",352.2,352.38],["advice",352.38,352.86],["would",352.86,353.04],["you",353.04,353.18],["give?",353.18,353.38]]},{"start":354.14,"end":355.52,"text":"Oh, let me think.","words":[["Oh,",354.14,354.58],["let",354.62,354.8],["me",354.8,354.92],["think.",354.92,355.52]]},{"start":357.02,"end":359.12,"text":"We didn't really have any problems.","words":[["We",357.02,357.54],["didn't",357.54,358.06],["really",358.06,358.32],["have",358.32,358.56],["any",358.56,358.72],["problems.",358.72,359.12]]},{"start":359.12,"end":361.6,"text":"Well, how did you get around when you were there?","words":[["Well,",359.12,359.68],["how",359.9,360.08],["did",360.08,360.2],["you",360.2,360.32],["get",360.32,360.44],["around",360.44,360.9],["when",360.9,361.14],["you",361.14,361.28],["were",361.28,361.4],["there?",361.4,361.6]]},{"start":362.32,"end":364.5,"text":"We wanted to get a motorbike at first.","words":[["We",362.32,362.48],["wanted",362.48,362.8],["to",362.8,363.0],["get",363.0,363.12],["a",363.12,363.3],["motorbike",363.3,363.9],["at",363.9,364.06],["first.",364.06,364.5]]},{"start":364.82,"end":368.88,"text":"They're very cheap to hire and great fun to ride as the roads are very good.","words":[["They're",364.82,365.02],["very",365.02,365.28],["cheap",365.28,365.56],["to",365.56,365.76],["hire",365.76,366.06],["and",366.06,366.36],["great",366.36,366.76],["fun",366.76,367.06],["to",367.06,367.22],["ride",367.22,367.54],["as",367.54,367.78],["the",367.78,367.9],["roads",367.9,368.2],["are",368.2,368.34],["very",368.34,368.56],["good.",368.56,368.88]]},{"start":369.42,"end":373.96,"text":"But it turned out not to be a good idea because the weather is so changeable.","words":[["But",369.42,369.7],["it",369.7,370.0],["turned",370.0,370.28],["out",370.28,370.5],["not",370.5,370.78],["to",370.78,370.98],["be",370.98,371.12],["a",371.12,371.22],["good",371.22,371.34],["idea",371.34,371.78],["because",371.78,372.2],["the",372.2,372.42],["weather",372.42,372.68],["is",372.68,372.94],["so",372.94,373.28],["changeable.",373.28,373.96]]},{"start":374.36,"end":376.12,"text":"You'd be much better off in a car.","words":[["You'd",374.36,374.8],["be",374.8,374.92],["much",374.92,375.16],["better",375.16,375.4],["off",375.4,375.62],["in",375.62,375.72],["a",375.72,375.82],["car.",375.82,376.12]]},{"start":376.6,"end":380.74,"text":"There are plenty of places where you can hire them and the roads are well signposted so","words":[["There",376.6,376.74],["are",376.74,376.82],["plenty",376.82,377.14],["of",377.14,377.32],["places",377.32,377.54],["where",377.54,377.82],["you",377.82,377.92],["can",377.92,378.04],["hire",378.04,378.28],["them",378.28,378.48],["and",378.48,379.0],["the",379.0,379.14],["roads",379.14,379.34],["are",379.34,379.48],["well",379.48,379.64],["signposted",379.64,380.54],["so",380.54,380.74]]},{"start":380.74,"end":381.58,"text":"you won't get lost.","words":[["you",380.74,380.94],["won't",380.94,381.1],["get",381.1,381.24],["lost.",381.24,381.58]]},{"start":381.86,"end":384.34,"text":"And presumably I can get a map when I get there?","words":[["And",381.86,382.1],["presumably",382.1,382.52],["I",382.52,382.94],["can",382.94,383.1],["get",383.1,383.22],["a",383.22,383.32],["map",383.32,383.56],["when",383.56,383.76],["I",383.76,383.9],["get",383.9,384.02],["there?",384.02,384.34]]},{"start":384.34,"end":390.12,"text":"Well you can, but they are expensive. It'd be better to get one here before you go.","words":[["Well",384.34,385.26],["you",385.26,385.58],["can,",385.58,385.98],["but",386.36,386.46],["they",386.46,386.64],["are",386.64,386.82],["expensive.",386.82,387.44],["It'd",388.1,388.28],["be",388.28,388.38],["better",388.38,388.6],["to",388.6,388.74],["get",388.74,388.9],["one",388.9,389.1],["here",389.1,389.44],["before",389.44,389.7],["you",389.7,389.9],["go.",389.9,390.12]]},{"start":390.54,"end":393.66,"text":"Great! That's been really useful. Thank you.","words":[["Great!",390.54,391.02],["That's",391.44,391.68],["been",391.68,391.8],["really",391.8,392.2],["useful.",392.2,392.76],["Thank",393.2,393.32],["you.",393.32,393.66]]},{"start":396.99,"end":402.23,"text":"That is the end of section one. You now have half a minute to check your answers.","words":[["That",396.99,397.39],["is",397.39,397.53],["the",397.53,397.65],["end",397.65,397.93],["of",397.93,398.11],["section",398.11,398.33],["one.",398.33,398.77],["You",399.63,399.83],["now",399.83,400.07],["have",400.07,400.41],["half",400.41,400.73],["a",400.73,400.93],["minute",400.93,401.13],["to",401.13,401.39],["check",401.39,401.67],["your",401.67,401.83],["answers.",401.83,402.23]]},{"start":432.7,"end":435.7,"text":"Now turn to section two on page three.","words":[["Now",432.7,433.0],["turn",433.0,433.26],["to",433.26,433.46],["section",433.46,433.76],["two",433.76,434.26],["on",434.26,434.96],["page",434.96,435.24],["three.",435.24,435.7]]}]}